# Force LF in the working tree on every platform, not just in the index.
#
# Biome's formatter emits LF, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# would rewrite every file to CRLF and `npm run lint` would report the whole
# repo as a format error on a fresh clone. eol=lf overrides autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.fxp binary
*.vstpreset binary
*.flac binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
